# Firebase Configuration for WMealPlan

Get your Firebase config from: https://console.firebase.google.com

## Frontend (.env.local in client/ folder)
REACT_APP_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your-web-api-key
REACT_APP_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your-project.firebaseapp.com
REACT_APP_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
REACT_APP_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your-project.appspot.com  
REACT_APP_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=123456789
REACT_APP_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:123456789:web:xxxxx
